From 40e27f0c11ca00e8aeafd0a6812eb55cfaca52ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:51:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add class serializer for
 Illuminate\Http\Client\Response

Register a default class serializer for Laravel HTTP client responses so
they show the status, reason, effective URL and content type instead of
just the class name when they appear in stack trace frames. Response
headers and the full URL are only included when send_default_pii is
enabled, the response body is never included. Class serializers set by
the user (for the response class or any parent class or interface) take
precedence.

Closes #1070
